 "text": "CLARIFICATION: addendum #2 (Qwen cancellation) mis-stated the run counts. It said 'Total actually-plannable runs going forward: 20 (Haiku/Sonnet), down from 44 registered in v4.' Correct figures: Haiku Kernel x8 + rules x8 + raw x8 = 24; Sonnet Kernel x3 + raw x3 = 6; Haiku+Sonnet total = 30 (not 20). v4's full registered total including the now-cancelled Qwen block (24) was 54 (not 44). This corrects the arithmetic only; the decision recorded in addendum #2 (Qwen cancelled, Haiku/Sonnet unaffected) is unchanged."
